# DesignHub environment variables
#
# DesignHub runs entirely in the browser and needs NO API keys or secrets.
# Copy this file to .env.local only if you want to override the value below.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local

# Public URL of your deployment, without a trailing slash. Used for canonical
# links, sitemap.xml, robots.txt and Open Graph metadata.
# Optional. Defaults to https://designhub.dev when unset.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# External services (documented here; none of them take a key)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Google Fonts CSS API (fonts.googleapis.com, fonts.gstatic.com)
#   Loads font previews and embeds brand fonts into SVG, PNG and PDF exports.
#   Free, public, no key.
#
# Google Fonts metadata (fonts.google.com/metadata/fonts)
#   Only used by `pnpm fonts:catalog` to refresh the bundled font catalog.
#   Free, public, no key. The app itself ships the catalog statically.
#
# Iconify API (api.iconify.design, mirrors api.simplesvg.com and api.unisvg.com)
#   Icon search and SVG data for Icon Studio. Free, public, no key.
#   Mirrors are tried automatically if the primary host is unreachable.
#
# Brand DNA runs on-device. The "AI (mock)" provider returns sample data and
# makes no network calls. A future model-backed provider would add its own
# variable here.
